<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sénégal Excursion et Découverte - Officiel</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        .tour-card { transition: transform 0.3s ease; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; background: white; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); position: relative; }
        .tour-card:hover { transform: translateY(-10px); }
        .tampon-inclus { position: absolute; top: 15px; right: 15px; width: 70px; height: 70px; background-color: #FDEF42; color: #00853F; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase; border: 3px dashed #00853F; transform: rotate(15deg); z-index: 30; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
        .price-tag { color: #E31B23; font-weight: 900; font-size: 1.5rem; }
        .hero-bg { background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.6), rgba(0,0,0,0.6)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580644315266-9b1686699709?q=80&w=2000'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; }
        .btn-wave { background-color: #22a1ff; }
        .btn-om { background-color: #ff7900; }
        .star-rating { color: #fbbf24; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 font-sans">

    <nav class="bg-[#00853F] text-white p-4 sticky top-0 z-50 border-b-4 border-[#FDEF42]">
        <div class="container mx-auto flex justify-between items-center px-4">
            <span class="font-black uppercase text-xl tracking-tighter">Sénégal Excursion</span>
            <a href="https://wa.me/221774721575" class="bg-[#E31B23] px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-bold text-sm flex items-center shadow-lg">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-phone mr-2"></i> +221 77 472 15 75
            </a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="hero-bg h-[40vh] flex items-center justify-center text-center text-white">
        <div class="px-6">
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-2 uppercase drop-shadow-lg">Nos 7 Circuits Détaillés</h2>
            <p class="text-lg font-bold text-[#FDEF42] uppercase italic tracking-widest">Yass Travel Tour</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section id="circuits" class="container mx-auto py-12 px-4">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            
            <div class="tour-card">
                <div class="tampon-inclus">Tout<br>Inclus</div>
                <img src="0141.jpeg?v=1" class="w-full h-56 object-cover">
                <div class="p-6 flex-grow flex flex-col">
                    <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-[#00853F] uppercase mb-3">Réserve de Bandia</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4 italic text-left">Safari 4x4 : Observez girafes, rhinocéros, zèbres et buffles. Inclus : Guide certifié et accès parc.</p>
                    <div class="mt-auto">
                        <p class="price-tag mb-4 text-center">60 000 CFA <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">/ 92€</span></p>
                        <a href="https://wa.me/221774721575?text=Réservation Bandia" class="block bg-[#00853F] text-white py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-center mb-3 shadow-md">Réserver</a>
                        <div class="flex gap-2 text-[10px] font-black text-white">
                            <div class="flex-1 btn-wave py-2 rounded-lg text-center uppercase">WAVE</div>
                            <div class="flex-1 btn-om py-2 rounded-lg text-center uppercase">ORANGE MONEY</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="tour-card">
                <div class="tampon-inclus">Tout<br>Inclus</div>
                <img src="0145.jpeg?v=1" class="w-full h-56 object-cover">
                <div class="p-6 flex-grow flex flex-col">
                    <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-[#00853F] uppercase mb-3">Sine Saloum</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4 italic text-left">Pirogue dans les mangroves, visite de l'île aux oiseaux et déjeuner sur l'île de Marlodj.</p>
                    <div class="mt-auto">
                        <p class="price-tag mb-4 text-center">50 000 CFA <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">/ 76€</span></p>
                        <a href="https://wa.me/221774721575?text=Réservation Saloum" class="block bg-[#00853F] text-white py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-center mb-3 shadow-md">Réserver</a>
                        <div class="flex gap-2 text-[10px] font-black text-white">
                            <div class="flex-1 btn-wave py-2 rounded-lg text-center uppercase">WAVE</div>
                            <div class="flex-1 btn-om py-2 rounded-lg text-center uppercase">ORANGE MONEY</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="tour-card">
                <div class="tampon-inclus">Tout<br>Inclus</div>
                <img src="0149.jpeg?v=1" class="w-full h-56 object-cover">
                <div class="p-6 flex-grow flex flex-col">
                    <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-[#00853F] uppercase mb-3">Lagune Somone</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4 italic text-left">Détente, observation des oiseaux migrateurs et balade en barque dans une réserve paisible.</p>
                    <div class="mt-auto">
                        <p class="price-tag mb-4 text-center">25 000 CFA <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">/ 38€</span></p>
                        <a href="https://wa.me/221774721575?text=Réservation Somone" class="block bg-[#00853F] text-white py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-center mb-3 shadow-md">Réserver</a>
                        <div class="flex gap-2 text-[10px] font-black text-white">
                            <div class="flex-1 btn-wave py-2 rounded-lg text-center uppercase">WAVE</div>
                            <div class="flex-1 btn-om py-2 rounded-lg text-center uppercase">ORANGE MONEY</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-12 px-4 border-t-2 border-gray-100">
        <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-center mb-10 uppercase text-gray-800">L'avis de nos clients</h3>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
                <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg">
                    <div class="star-rating mb-1 text-sm italic">★★★★★</div>
                    <p class="text-sm italic mb-2">"Une journée parfaite à Bandia avec Yass. Organisation sérieuse."</p>
                    <p class="text-xs font-bold">- Marie P.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg">
                    <div class="star-rating mb-1 text-sm italic">★★★★★</div>
                    <p class="text-sm italic mb-2">"Le Sine Saloum est magnifique. Paiement par Wave très pratique."</p>
                    <p class="text-xs font-bold">- Jean-Luc D.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-100 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-inner">
                <h4 class="font-bold text-center mb-4 uppercase text-sm">Donnez votre avis !</h4>
                <form class="space-y-4">
                    <input type="text" placeholder="Votre nom" class="w-full p-3 rounded-lg border-none shadow-sm text-sm">
                    <select class="w-full p-3 rounded-lg border-none shadow-sm text-sm star-rating">
                        <option value="5">★★★★★ (Excellent)</option>
                        <option value="4">★★★★☆ (Très bien)</option>
                        <option value="3">★★★☆☆ (Bien)</option>
                    </select>
                    <textarea placeholder="Votre commentaire..." class="w-full p-3 rounded-lg border-none shadow-sm text-sm h-24"></textarea>
                    <button type="button" class="w-full bg-[#E31B23] text-white font-black py-3 rounded-lg uppercase tracking-widest text-sm shadow-lg">Envoyer mon avis</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="bg-gray-900 text-white py-12 text-center border-t-8 border-[#FDEF42]">
        <h4 class="text-[#FDEF42] font-black text-2xl mb-2 uppercase italic tracking-tighter">Yass Travel Tour</h4>
        <div class="flex justify-center space-x-6 mb-6">
            <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d9/Wave_Logo_S%C3%A9n%C3%A9gal.png" class="h-6">
            <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Orange_logo.svg/1024px-Orange_logo.svg.png" class="h-6">
        </div>
        <p class="font-black text-xl">+221 77 472 15 75</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
